#: cheats.c:3101
msgid "Finds where a value (lives, health, ammo, or with Size 2 bytes a score) is kept. 1. First Scan. 2. Change it in the game (lose a life ...). 3. Choose what to Find (and the Value), click Next Scan (Undo Scan takes it back); repeat until a few addresses are left. 4. Select one, type the value to hold in Set to, then Add Cheat, or double-click it to change its value, or Freeze it, to try it at once."
